<title>USA: Paragon Group Inc lowers qtly div.</title>
<headline>Paragon Group Inc lowers qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paragon Group Inc said it reduced its quarterly dividend to $0.3136 per share from $0.465 per share because of the proposed merger between Paragon Group and Camden Property Trust.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 15 to shareholders of record March 31.</p>
<p>Paragon Group is a real estate investment trust.</p>
</text>
